   "finest_note": "Counted by municipality; the Oberland and Unterland districts are the contests. Postal and in-person votes are split in the protocol, not by station.",
   "note": "25 members since 1989 (15 for the Oberland, 10 for the Unterland) and 15 before, elected by list PR in the two districts with a national 8% threshold; each voter has as many votes as the district has seats, unused ones count for the list as Zusatzstimmen (Verfassung Art. 46; VRG Art. 55-56). Each list also elects deputy members (stellvertretende Abgeordnete). Majority vote until PR was introduced in 1939; women vote since 1984.",
